{C:8193FE01}{C:81958296B11B00000000}If I'm hit,
I'll hit right back!!


{x00}

{C:8193FF01}{C:81958296B31B00000000}Did we lose
because I'm the captain...?


{x00}

{C:8193FF01}{C:81958296B91B00000000}You could put up a barrage or something!
Do something!!


{x00}

{C:81930A02}{C:81958296C11B00000000}Well, I'll watch for the right moment
to get out.


{x00}

{C:81931E02}{C:81958296C91B00000000}My troops and I
aren't that fragile!


{x00}

{C:81932D02}{C:81958296D11B00000000}I swear on my pride as a Federation soldier:
I will never retreat!


{x00}

{C:81933C02}{C:81958296F11B00000000}I guess this much
can't be helped.

{x00}

{C:81934402}{C:81958296F61B00000000}I'll use the main gun.
I'm counting on you to get it ready.


{x00}

{C:81935002}{C:81958296031C00000000}Even though now isn't
the time to fight...

{x00}

{C:81935A02}{C:819582960C1C00000000}I'd ask you not to underestimate
the Blue Hawk of Giganos.

{x00}

{C:81935E02}{C:81958296111C00000000}Get the main gun ready,
and don't drag your feet!


{x00}

{C:81935E02}{C:81958296151C00000000}Let's give them
a little surprise, shall we?


{x00}

{C:81935E02}{C:81958296171C00000000}Damn it, when I deal with you bastards,
the expenses just keep piling up.


{x00}

{C:81935F02}{C:81958296191C00000000}Me, of all people...
I'm pulling back!


{x00}

{C:81937E02}{C:819582964E1C00000000}It's all right.
I believe in all of you.


{x00}

{C:8193A602}{C:81958296701C00000000}Ah, playing with Himiko and Wataru
would be more fun.


{x00}

{C:8193B502}{C:81958296C51C00000000}I can't believe
that I'd take damage!

{x00}

{C:8193BE02}{C:81958296E91C00000000}We won't last like this!
Do something!


{x00}

{C:8193C202}{C:81958296091D00000000}I can't leave the burden
to my seniors alone!

{x00}

{C:8193C702}{C:81958296321D00000000}Everyone,
please don't push yourselves too hard.

{x00}

{C:8193C802}{C:819582963B1D00000000}Everyone in the attack force,
I'm counting on you to do something!


{x00}

{C:8193C902}{C:81958296451D00000000}Damn it,
the enemy's impressive. I'll give them that!


{x00}

{C:8193CA02}{C:819582964A1D00000000}If you all behave yourselves,
I'll give you a present.


{x00}

{C:8193CA02}{C:819582964B1D00000000}All right, I'll start covering you!
Make sure you dodge!


{x00}

{C:8193CA02}{C:819582964D1D00000000}Hey, come on, everyone, give it your all!
Otherwise, it'll mean death!


{x00}

{C:8193CB02}{C:81958296521D00000000}I'll get ready to cover you,
so hang on just a little.


{x00}

{C:8193CB02}{C:81958296551D00000000}If I don't do my best too,
things might get dangerous.


{x00}

{C:8193CC02}{C:819582965B1D00000000}I'll provide cover.
Make sure you dodge, all right?


{x00}

{C:8193CC02}{C:819582965C1D00000000}Hey, hey,
I took damage over here too!

{x00}

{C:8193CC02}{C:819582965D1D00000000}If you don't try a little harder,
we're all headed for the afterlife.


{x00}

{C:8193CD02}{C:819582965F1D00000000}A-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha! I'm going dooown!
Whiiiir, then ka-booom!


{x00}

{C:8193CD02}{C:81958296601D00000000}Main guuun, where aaare you?
Will it work if I fiddle around here?


{x00}

{C:8193CD02}{C:81958296611D00000000}I'm firing the main guuun!
Ka-booom! Crackle-crackle-craaackle!


{x00}

{C:8193CD02}{C:81958296631D00000000}All right, I'll provide cooover!
Sorry to anyone I hiiit!


{x00}

{C:81936600}{C:81958296D53900000000}I'm going down... Me, of all people...
Impossibleee!!

{x00}

{C:81936600}{C:81958296D63900000000}Heh-heh-heh... Haah-ha-ha... Huh?
Am I going down!?


{x00}

{C:81936600}{C:81958296D73900000000}I'll strike at the enemy positions!
Prepare to open fire!

{x00}

{C:81936600}{C:81958296DC3900000000}I'll provide covering fire.
If you get caught in it... die!!

{x00}

{C:81936600}{C:81958296DD3900000000}Now, friendlies, clear the way!
I'm providing covering fire!!


{x00}

{C:81936300}{C:81958296E83900000000}Prepare to open fire.
I'll strike at the enemy positions.

{x00}

{C:81936300}{C:81958296E93900000000}Get ready to attack.
Aim to finish it with this.


{x00}

{C:81936300}{C:81958296ED3900000000}I'll provide covering fire.
Don't hit our allies.


{x00}

{C:81936300}{C:81958296F03900000000}I can't afford to go down
over something like this!

{x00}

{C:81935D00}{C:81958296F53900000000}Bombard the enemy positions!
Hurry with the preparations!

{x00}

{C:81935D00}{C:81958296F63900000000}Allies in the line of fire, move!
You'll get caught in it!


{x00}

{C:81935D00}{C:81958296F93900000000}I'll cover our allies!
Hurry with the preparations!

{x00}

{C:81935D00}{C:81958296FA3900000000}Get ready to provide cover.
Be careful not to hit our allies!


{x00}

{C:81935D00}{C:81958296003A00000000}Don't flinch!
This much won't sink me!

{x00}

{C:81935E00}{C:81958296093A00000000}We'll attack the enemy ship!
Hurry with preparations!

{x00}

{C:81935E00}{C:819582960A3A00000000}We'll reduce the enemy's fighting strength.
Hurry and prepare to bombard their positions!


{x00}

{C:81935E00}{C:819582960B3A00000000}You're ready, aren't you?
All right! Fiiire!!

{x00}

{C:81935E00}{C:819582960D3A00000000}Cover our allies!
Hurry and get ready.

{x00}

{C:81935E00}{C:819582960E3A00000000}We'll provide covering fire.
Don't hit our allies!


{x00}

{C:81935E00}{C:81958296113A00000000}Oh, you're quite capable.
But that's still not enough!

{x00}

{C:81935E00}{C:81958296133A00000000}Don't panic!
As long as we aren't shot down, it doesn't matter!

{x00}

{C:81935E00}{C:81958296143A00000000}Tch, a fine attack.
But you're the ones who'll go down in the end!


{x00}

{C:81933400}{C:81958296343A00000000}I am Louser, Louser Luft.
And I, of all people... in a place like this!!


{x00}

{C:81933400}{C:819582963C3A00000000}What are you doing?
Give our allies cover!!


{x00}

{C:8193E402}{C:81958296161800000000}To think you need cover,
you pathetic fools!


{x00}

{C:8193E402}{C:819582961B1800000000}Don't think an attack this weak
will work on me.

{x00}

{C:81932D00}{C:81958296AC3A00000000}Our allies need cover...
All right, prepare to provide it!


{x00}

{C:81932D00}{C:81958296AF3A00000000}You can still keep going, right?
We'll counterattack.

